WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
When they make a movie
out of this podcast,

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:03.300
Tom Hanks will play you.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.930
Yeah, you're a hero.
That's right.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.502
Hey, wasn't he nice on
the podcast the other day?

00:00:07.502 --> 00:00:09.390
[Sona] Oh, I love him so much.

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.223
Isn't he the best?

00:00:10.223 --> 00:00:11.090
He's the nicest guy.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.800
And people always say that.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.090
I'm telling you, I've known him since 1988

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.980
And I've I've spent, you know,

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.560
when you add up all the time

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.510
that I've been around him,

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:26.200
I've only see him be a gracious,

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.052
really nice, fascinating guy.

00:00:28.052 --> 00:00:30.680
Very funny, very smart.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.510
Do you know that when
you guys were talking

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.380
about World War II, I would never do this.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.671
I would never interrupt,
but I wanted to talk.

00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:39.490
Just, I love talking about that stuff.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.400
And I was just drooling while you guys

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.800
were talking about that.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.660
Yeah.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.230
No, I'm glad you didn't jump in.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.477
[Matt] No, I know you're glad.

00:00:47.477 --> 00:00:48.447
(Sona giggles)

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:49.451
No, but you know what I mean.

00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:50.284
You know what I mean?

00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:51.117
Yeah, I would never.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:51.950
I would never.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:52.783
It's not.
Yeah.

00:00:52.783 --> 00:00:53.616
I'm just saying, like,

00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:54.780
but I could have listened to you guys

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.420
go on for hours about that.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.560
No, when two icons of film are talking,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.450
you don't, you just wanna let them go.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.890
You're an icon of film?

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:02.970
Yeah, what?
I was cut out

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.838
of the Coneheads movie.

00:01:04.838 --> 00:01:06.337
(laughing) What were you?

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.490
A conehead in the background.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:12.200
That's a true story. (laughing)

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.033
Lorne Michaels,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:13.940
I was out here--
Did you know

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.870
they removed you (laughing)
from the background?

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.040
Lorne Michaels wanted,

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.080
it was when he was talking to me

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.320
about doing the "Late Night" show,

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.760
and he wanted to have a meeting with me.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.707
And then he just was like,

00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:24.760
"Just I'll meet you at
Paramount or whatever."

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:25.593
And I went, okay.

00:01:25.593 --> 00:01:26.647
And I went to Paramount, then he went,

00:01:26.647 --> 00:01:29.387
"Just listen, you're at Paramount anyway.

00:01:29.387 --> 00:01:32.637
"Just be in the background
of this Coneheads movie.

00:01:32.637 --> 00:01:34.170
"We're making the Coneheads movie."

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:36.510
'Cause the best time to make
a movie about the Coneheads

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.940
is 25 years after it's been
(Matt laughs)

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:41.580
a huge hit on television.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.390
But anyway, he said, "Just
be in the background."

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:46.220
And I went, you don't say no to Lorne.

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:47.067
And I went, okay.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:49.127
"And then, you know, when
you're done doing that,

00:01:49.127 --> 00:01:50.347
"we'll talk."

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.920
And so the next thing you know,

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.900
I'm in a trailer, and they're
putting a big cone on my head.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:02.720
And then I walk out, and
those things are ridiculous.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.650
They're really heavy.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.930
And you can't maneuver.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.590
And I'm tall anyway, I'm six-four,

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:08.620
but the cone made me about seven-four.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.020
Oh my God.
Or seven-five.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:15.020
And then I was like, oh
man, this is really painful.

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.350
I'm just gonna lie down.

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:19.787
And this person with a
headset and a clipboard said,

00:02:19.787 --> 00:02:20.620
"Don't lie down!

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.717
"You can't lie down!

00:02:21.717 --> 00:02:24.247
"You have to keep standing
until your scene is shot,

00:02:24.247 --> 00:02:26.370
"because you'll ruin the cone."

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.900
And I'm literally, it's
like a crowd scene,

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:29.920
and I'm in the background.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.010
You don't even know it's me.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.387
And I'm thinking, "I just was here

00:02:32.387 --> 00:02:33.337
"to talk to Lorne."

00:02:33.337 --> 00:02:35.207
"Get over there and wait!

00:02:35.207 --> 00:02:38.610
"And in 40 minutes, we'll throw
some ground chuck your way."

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:41.710
And so I'm I waiting.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.990
And then I'm in the background,

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:44.590
and they go, okay, "Action!"

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.479
Literally there's, I mean,
I'm so far from the camera

00:02:47.479 --> 00:02:50.020
that I can't even see the camera.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.947
And I hear, you know, Dan Akroyd say,

00:02:51.947 --> 00:02:52.977
"Yes, Blendar!

00:02:52.977 --> 00:02:54.406
"No, Blendar!
(Sona giggles)

00:02:54.406 --> 00:02:55.239
"Boo!"

00:02:55.239 --> 00:02:56.072
And Jane curtain goes, "Boo!"

00:02:56.072 --> 00:02:57.507
And they go "And cut!

00:02:57.507 --> 00:03:01.547
"Okay, we'll do that one
more time in six hours.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:02.380
"Everyone leave.
(Sona giggles)

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.270
"No one lie down."
(Matt laughs)

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:07.100
And then finally I shot the scene.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.950
Of course they never used that scene!

